    <section class="content-section content-section--soft">
      <div class="content-shell">
        <p class="content-kicker">Ask before you buy</p>
        <div class="question-grid">
          <article><h2>How often will I use it?</h2><p>If it serves only one theme or one day, consider borrowing it or making a simple version first.</p></article>
          <article><h2>What will students do with it?</h2><p>Name the action—sort, move, explain, build, compare, or display—instead of settling for “it looks good in a classroom.”</p></article>
          <article><h2>Is there a low-cost version?</h2><p>Keep an option that does not depend on purchasing so the activity remains usable in different classrooms and budgets.</p></article>
